  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A block slides down a frictionless ramp from a vertical height of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The block arrives at the bottom of the ramp at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> and it eventually comes to rest on a rough horizontal surface after travelling through distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>. The coefficient of dynamic friction between the block and the surface is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{\\mu}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\mu}{x}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v^{2}}{\\mu g}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v^{2}}{\\mu g}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
